 Silicon Oasis. Dubai is where most of our published portfolio sits, and where our onsite engineers are most often deployed.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=BIM%20staffing%3A%20Dubai\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><address class=\"cbox\" style=\"font-style:normal\"><h3>Supported from</h3><a href=\"https://g.page/BIM-SERVICES-PROVIDER?share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Office 608, Apricot Tower,<br>Dubai Silicon Oasis, Dubai, UAE</a><a href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a><a href=\"mailto:enquiry@engisoftengineering.com\">enquiry@engisoftengineering.com</a></address></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">How we deliver</p><h2 class=\"h2\">BIM staffing <em>in Dubai.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"next\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01 / ONSITE BIM ENGINEERS</b><h3 class=\"h3\">Architects, structural and MEP engineers, coordinators and BIM managers embedded with your Dubai project team.</h3></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02 / REMOTE AND DEDICATED TEAMS</b><h3 class=\"h3\">Remote engineers or a dedicated team with its own BIM lead, working in your CDE.</h3></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03 / SELECTION BEFORE MOBILIZATION</b><h3 class=\"h3\">Assessed profiles, a client interview and onboarding to your BEP before anyone starts.</h3></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Available professionals</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Who we place <em>here.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"